ge coaches look for immediately when they press play\\n- The exact structure, order, and formatting that gets coaches to keep watching\\n- And how to avoid the common mistakes that quietly kill recruiting\\n\\nIf you don’t want your son’s highlight video to keep getting ignored, click the link below and save your seat before we fill up\",\n          \"title\": \"Unlock D1-Style Highlights in 60 Minutes 🏈\",\n          \"caption\": \"gonextplay.com\",\n          \"linkUrl\": \"https://gonextplay.com/free-training-highlights\",\n          \"linkDescription\": \"Join our free workshop to learn proven steps to get college coaches' attention and help your son earn football scholarship offers without connections.\",\n          \"callToAction\": \"Learn more\",\n          \"callToActionType\": \"LEARN_MORE\",\n          \"displayFormat\": \"IMAGE\",\n          \"images\": [\n            {\n              \"url\": \"https://scontent-lga3-3.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/855645290_1295112446037712_8991012347626586818_n.jpg?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=fGmmlzPBtf8Q7kNvwGe5tQT&_nc_oc=AdoDyuEayjlLremjk-08rIL_MW66lfBCW-dZh54iw74n_lFHuFjcGIt7mKUJ9POgSaM&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.xx&_nc_gid=xvYMHfFvYE_1feo8MaeCkw&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQS-dvsc5xKGRRbCWiQ487i7SWAW3euldB_dsx8TwWMWnA&oe=6AF3E193\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"videos\": [],\n          \"cards\": []\n        },\n        \"brandedContent\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"27921815420828711\",\n        \"adId\": null,\n        \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/ads/library?id=27921815420828711\",\n        \"page\": {\n          \"id\": \"990707490939476\",\n          \"name\": \"Richie Contartesi\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/RelentlessRichie/\",\n          \"isDeleted\": false,\n          \"profilePictureUrl\": \"https://scontent-lga3-3.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/855062498_1306919599179300_1468041235748448465_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_s