e to circle your son so coaches never miss him. \n\n📍Step three: Build his online brand. Set up a clean Bio X and post three to seven times each week.\n\n📍Step four: Reach out to college coaches, not to beg for an offer, but to find the area coach at each school you're targeting and get them to watch this highlight video. \n\n📍Step 5: Build genuine relationships with college coaches. After they've watched his highlight video, make it about helping the coach win, not about getting an offer.","title":null,"caption":null,"linkUrl":null,"linkDescription":null,"callToAction":null,"callToActionType":null,"displayFormat":"VIDEO","images":[],"videos":[{"hdUrl":"https://video-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m69/AQPslIJgOboAtyg1BPcJiJYysxC6thnQrYtV7S9dQrD2VGAMNsTYHFYzBqAYH10e13_39mthzTgJ8VB_toXCx_l5.mp4?strext=1&_nc_cat=101&_nc_sid=ef5aa3&_nc_ht=video-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=z3Be-3PKEvoQ7kNvwHw_l_l&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLnByb2dyZXNzaXZlX2gyNjQtYmFzaWMtZ2VuMl83MjBwIiwieHB2X2Fzc2V0X2lkIjoyMDE5NjY1NzA4ODgyMDM0LCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6MzM3LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDgyNywiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6ODUsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=xvYMHfFvYE_1feo8MaeCkw&_nc_ss=78180&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRrMdoTdBE9tCHGN-NS036yLlCjuddePB-JVZv5A8lkbA&oe=6AF3EAF1","sdUrl":"https://video-lga3-3.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m69/AQNOiTVRGEPO0Zs9hfK4IYeZ94egzXdXFdQ3jpjzrt3Y5LHTvcDolytWZp0CcmpRmkV_USbDrMkXaR9sZfwGtkRp.mp4?strext=1&_nc_cat=102&_nc_sid=ef5aa3&_nc_ht=video-lga3-3.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=E0I6X_mxOAoQ7kNvwEXQ79Q&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuMzYwLnByb2dyZXNzaXZlX2gyNjQtYmFzaWMtZ2VuMl8zNjBwIiwieHB2X2Fzc2V0X2lkIjoyMDE5NjY1NzA4ODgyMDM0LCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6MzM3LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDgyNywiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6ODUsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=xvYMHfFvYE_1feo8MaeCkw&_nc_ss=78180&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRwf3_pPUUqtk2LuyssJ6byI_XYB1UOZuw3fCJVl-2tiQ&oe=6AF3D1E8"