nAnd you don't have thousands of hours to learn the recruiting process…\n\nPlus, you're probably already paying for personal trainers, private schools, and maybe even a nutritionist because you don't want to let your son settle for average. \n\nBut he's still not getting the level of exposure he deserves and you have no idea where to start.\n\nWell, if that's you, Then keep reading…\n\nI'm looking for a few more highly motivated families to work with 1-on-1 who are tired of the endless cycle of camps, recruiting services, and frustrating “recruiting softwares”…\n\nAnd who want to invest in mentorship that will transform their son into a confident communicator and marketer.\n\nAs a high-performing leader yourself, you don’t settle for average in your work, and you don’t want your son to settle for average either.\n\nYour son is already an extremely hard worker on the field and in the weight room, but he is either shy or doesn’t understand that college football recruiting is now a business…\n\nThis means he also must develop the skills to properly market and sell himself…\n\nAs well as build unshakable confidence in himself to build real relationships with college coaches...\n\nBecause outside of just being a good player, that’s what it takes to earn a scholarship in the new NIL/Portal era.\n\nIt’s no secret that doing outreach yourself is free…But the protocol I teach is reserved for those who value their time…\n\nAnd want the protocols normally reserved for the top 1% of high school football players.\n\nThe Next Play® System is expensive, exclusive, and wildly effective.\n\nIn fact, not only did I earn a D1 football scholarship at Ole Miss, despite being just 5’7 and 150 lbs (and no, not a kicker 😅)…\n\nBut 94% of my athletes have earned scholarships worth $100,000 - $200,000, with 42% going Division 1.\n\nHow? While others waste time at camps without relationships built before attending, sending generic emails through recruiting software, or just seeking “exposure”...\n\nI focus on transforming driven high school football players into confident leaders, communicators, and businessmen…\n\nGiving them a step-by-step scholarship system to follow and enabling them to build relationships with college coaches, leading to scholarship offers.\n\nThe entire protocol for earning a scholarship, the college football business, leadership, and mental toughness, are all addressed.\n\nDo exactly what we say, and you can watch your son run out of the tunnel in front of 100,000 screaming fans, then post about it for the world to see.\n\nThis way, like my parents, you can prove all his haters wrong and laugh as you listen to other parents blame the portal and every other made-up excuse besides doing what actually works.\n\nClick the \"learn more\" button to see if it's the right fit.\n\n~ Richie Contartesi\n\nP.S. This is not a recruiting service, so if you don’t understand the value of mentorship, then please keep scrolling.","title":"Earn a College Football Scholarship 🏈","caption":"gonextplay.com","linkUrl":"https://gonextplay.com/application-ads","linkDescription":"Next Play® is the ultimate college football scholarship program, empowering underdog athletes to overcome challenges, gain attention from coaches, and secure their dream offers. Join our thriving community and unleash your potential today.","callToAction":"See details","callToActionType":"SEE_DETAILS","displayFormat":"IMAGE","images":[{"url":"https://scontent-lga3-3.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/862067156_1611592389852189_3485694864680910928_n.jpg?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=uJ7QP4dSA58Q7kNvwEbaV71&_nc_oc=AdpZGzLla9qpID_XK0Mwwr7yvjim9rBEv-kY4JQwOT3_r5nNG_Nh3aROLHoFvQs5QfA&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.xx&_nc_gid=xvYMHfFvYE_1feo8MaeCkw&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQTqNxuOjrLH8gCP57pIa8TqF4283J5gXDJLOxriIcNnFQ&oe=6AF3F070"}],"videos":[],"cards":[]},"brandedContent":null},{"id":"1121537123742155","adId":null,"url":"https://www.facebook.com/ads/library?id=1121537123742155","pag