 your son earn a college football offer.\n\n~ Richie Contartesi","title":"Earn a College Football Scholarship 🏈","caption":"gonextplay.com","linkUrl":"https://gonextplay.com/application-ads","linkDescription":null,"callToAction":"Learn more","callToActionType":"LEARN_MORE","displayFormat":"VIDEO","images":[],"videos":[{"hdUrl":"https://video-lga3-3.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQM4Q08SuMazivRijnUUX5pxwSS0zNBDBA5Eq27jthEwuJSheS0jAyZSUnnYJkosm4Y7vhomYhD6nYf84UuvBDAC_VG5YhjEYIlHlUdskyPUAw.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_sid=b66105&_nc_ht=video-lga3-3.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=u2KDvQvYg4IQ7kNvwEselo_&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjQxOTMyNTU4MDQzMDU2NDUsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjoxNywidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTAxMzksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjExOSwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=b8f3198076f368c&_nc_vs=HBksFQIYRWZiX2VwaGVtZXJhbC9GM0ZCQjY5QTk3RTU0MTREQkEyMkRBMkIxNkE3NUI0OF9tdF8xX3ZpZGVvX2Rhc2hpbml0Lm1wNBUAAsgBEgAVAhhAZmJfcGVybWFuZW50LzdEMEE1NjJCNDgwNzQ1Q0U4Q0U4QjNGMTYwNDlDODA2X2F1ZGlvX2Rhc2hpbml0Lm1wNBUCAsgBEgAoABgAGwKIB3VzZV9vaWwBMRJwcm9ncmVzc2l2ZV9yZWNpcGUBMRUAACbag9iqzu_yDhUCKAJDMywXQF3E_fO2RaIYGWRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHARAHUAZbaeAQA&_nc_gid=xvYMHfFvYE_1feo8MaeCkw&_nc_ss=78180&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQmUsvgtLIBE0NRGg_xLkm1nUYJLnRJxidUaLlFdx1bxw&oe=6AF3EFEA","sdUrl":"https://video-lga3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m412/AQOywYpThKd9gFJY8vDLtX3AUr-hQtz4czP0qua_1OTpxfe7Ti5ti8TnI9U5_byyLUV4kGPNNGfiuOq1Z69C9dsjsgCg2ZzQ7OIlGsZmcg.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=ef5aa3&_nc_ht=video-lga3-1.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=v8CHw0PAHKAQ7kNvwEpriaA&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuMzYwLnN2ZV9zZCIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6NDE5MzI1NTgwNDMwNTY0NSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjE3LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDEzOSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MTE5LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=xvYMHfFvYE_1feo8MaeCkw&_nc_ss=78180&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQmkpSPnRWGByEPnohrG_3YFN11m6buxI6s_bhlmWnD6Q&