,"countries":[],"impressions":{"text":null,"index":-1},"spend":null,"creative":{"bodyText":"Parents of High School Football Players In The 27/28 Class…\n\nIs your son sending out his highlight video — but getting little to no response from college coaches?\n\nYou record the games.\nYou cut the clips.\nYou upload the film.\nAnd then… silence.\n\nNo replies.\nNo feedback.\nNo clear next step.\nNo idea what’s wrong.\n\nHere’s what most parents don’t realize:\n\"just having\" a highlight video isn’t enough.\n\nIf it’s too long, poorly structured, or doesn’t show what coaches are actually looking for in the first 15 seconds, they click off — even if your son is talented.\n\nThat’s why I’m hosting a free live virtual workshop, where I’ll break down:\n\n- How to build a D1-style highlight video in 60 minutes or less\n- What college coaches look for immediately when they press play\n- The exact structure, order, and formatting that gets coaches to keep watching\n- And how to avoid the common mistakes that quietly kill recruiting\n\nIf you don’t want your son’s highlight video to keep getting ignored, click the link below and save your seat before we fill up","title":"Unlock D1-Style Highlights in 60 Minutes 🏈","caption":"gonextplay.com","linkUrl":"https://gonextplay.com/free-training-highlights","linkDescription":"Join our free workshop to learn proven steps to get college coaches' attention and help your son earn football scholarship offers without connections.","callToAction":"Learn more","callToActionType":"LEARN_MORE","displayFormat":"IMAGE","images":[{"url":"https://scontent-lga3-3.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/855645290_1295112446037712_8991012347626586818_n.jpg?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=fGmmlzPBtf8Q7kNvwGe5tQT&_nc_oc=AdoDyuEayjlLremjk-08rIL_MW66lfBCW-dZh54iw74n_lFHuFjcGIt7mKUJ9POgSaM&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.xx&_nc_gid=xvYMHfFvYE_1feo8MaeCkw&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQS-dvsc5xKGRRbCWiQ487i7SWAW3euldB_dsx8TwWMWnA&oe=6AF3E193"}],"videos":[],"cards":[]},