es that quietly kill recruiting\n\nIf you don’t want your son’s highlight video to keep getting ignored, click the link below and save your seat before we fill up","title":"Unlock D1-Style Highlights in 60 Minutes 🏈","caption":"gonextplay.com","linkUrl":"https://gonextplay.com/free-training-highlights","linkDescription":"Join our free workshop to learn proven steps to get college coaches' attention and help your son earn football scholarship offers without connections.","callToAction":"Learn more","callToActionType":"LEARN_MORE","displayFormat":"IMAGE","images":[{"url":"https://scontent-lga3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/854414169_1268576962107367_3820403616065349475_n.jpg?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=0YTs1yv4UC8Q7kNvwGQVZse&_nc_oc=AdoTaJfE5ho89nI3blZP8aqAWdojhuhBDA5lYSjzlSZl_penWE-z-6K1qmdOQ_OoAOc&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.xx&_nc_gid=xvYMHfFvYE_1feo8MaeCkw&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQQ5fSpJrtqWLRNbbZ4p1467vFIxn-d0VI45_OAGZJ_Ywg&oe=6AF3DAB1"}],"videos":[],"cards":[]},"brandedContent":null},{"id":"1378645114083365","adId":null,"url":"https://www.facebook.com/ads/library?id=1378645114083365","page":{"id":"990707490939476","name":"Richie Contartesi","url":"https://www.facebook.com/RelentlessRichie/","isDeleted":false,"profilePictureUrl":"https://scontent-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/862617718_1383550537185312_2388803890632001464_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s60x60_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=MiYyu3mC00EQ7kNvwG2DlHc&_nc_oc=AdquicFoo5gQyqQKXkB9I_3z6li2AAkfl5h4MNjDM13wh59MGmopilGqc3k0ObzwZSk&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.xx&_nc_gid=xvYMHfFvYE_1feo8MaeCkw&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQR5R2cAAX-uE52w3YnhdSCfhfVcYRPRplBlL7i2RwA5tw&oe=6AF3FB82","likeCount":10108,"categories":["Entrepreneur"]},"campaign":{"collationId":"1792959438587098","collationCount":1},"isActive":true,"publisherPlatforms":["FACEBOOK","INSTAGRAM","AUDIENCE_NETWORK","WHATSAPP","THREADS"],"startedAt":"2026-10-27T07:00:00.000Z","endedAt":"2026-11-06T08:00:00.000Z","categories":["UNKNOWN"],"countries":[],"impressions":{"text":null,"index":-1},"spend":null,"creative":{"bodyText":"Parents of High School Football Players In The 27/28 Classes... 🏈\n\nGet your son a professional evaluation from a Division 1 Recruiting Director with 15 years of college football recruiting experience.\n\nThe recruiting process can feel extremely overwhelming...\n\nAnd most families have no idea where to start.\n\nThat’s why we offer a professional evaluation—the first step to make sure your son's highlight video is set up correctly, the plays are in the right order, and he's targeting the right schools in the right divisions, so he's not wasting his time.\n\nBecause without this step, everything he does to market himself or reach out to coaches will be a giant waste of time.\n\nIn your professional evaluation, we will provide:\n\n1️⃣ An honest assessment of your son’s current playing level—where he has the best chance to earn a scholarship right now—whether that’s Division 1, Division 2, Division 3, or NAIA.\n\n2️⃣ A personalized plan outlining exactly what your son needs to do to reach the next level from where he is today.\n\n3️⃣ Targeted edits to improve his highlight video so that when he sends it to coaches, it gets noticed—and gets responses.\n\n✅ We can ONLY evaluate players with Freshman, JV, or Varsity game film.\n\n❌ Please do click below if your son does not have Freshman, JV, or Varsity game film\n\nSpots are filling up fast with this limited-time price reduction...\n\nSo click 'Learn More' below to book a 15-minute call and find out if your son meets the criteria for a professional evaluation before the price goes back up.\n\n~ Richie Contartesi","title":"Get A D1 Football Evaluation","caption":"gonextplay.com","linkUrl":"https://gonextplay.com/evaluation","linkDescription":null,"callToAction":"Learn more","callToActionType":"LEARN_MORE","displayFormat":"VIDEO","images":[],"videos":[{"hdUrl":"https://video-lga3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQPJn3Rji-fneDgEG_db